[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13741.269, "timestamp": "03:49:01", "text": "それは「オーマイゴッド」です。それはダメです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13743.62, "timestamp": "03:49:03", "text": "死ぬな。しないで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13745.63, "timestamp": "03:49:05", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13756.87, "timestamp": "03:49:16", "text": "安全。わかった。ここは安全です。わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13758.6, "timestamp": "03:49:18", "text": "感謝"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13761.55, "timestamp": "03:49:21", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13765.83, "timestamp": "03:49:25", "text": "神。食料が足りない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13772.67, "timestamp": "03:49:32", "text": "あまりにも。見つけて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13775.51, "timestamp": "03:49:35", "text": "待って。待って、待って、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13778.55, "timestamp": "03:49:38", "text": "待って、待って。確認することが可能です"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13785.15, "timestamp": "03:49:45", "text": "忘れた。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13789.07, "timestamp": "03:49:49", "text": "えっと、どうやって確認すればいいですか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13791.07, "timestamp": "03:49:51", "text": "テレポート"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13794.07, "timestamp": "03:49:54", "text": "指示？待って、TPコマンドがあるよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13795.389, "timestamp": "03:49:55", "text": "いいえ、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13797.95, "timestamp": "03:49:57", "text": "忘れた。"}]